NOTE: The data set WORK.EPIDEMIC has 10 observations and 5 variables.

9532       ;
9533       run;
9534       proc probit data=epidemic;
9535       class treat sex;
9536       model r/n = dose treat sex treat*sex;
9537       slice treat*sex / diff;
9538       effectplot;
9539       run;


